#: lumos.core.element:1 of
msgid "Base class of every LUMOS element: equipment, optical component, detector or processing block."
msgstr ""

#: lumos.core.element:3 of
msgid ""
"An element declares its fields (:class:`~lumos.core.param.Param`, :class:`~lumos.core.param.State`, "
":class:`~lumos.core.param.Setting`) and its ports (:class:`~lumos.core.port.Input`, "
":class:`~lumos.core.port.Output`) as class attributes, and implements its behaviour as a **pure** transfer "
"function::"
msgstr ""

#: lumos.core.element:19 of
msgid ""
"``transfer`` must be a ``staticmethod``: it cannot read or modify the element itself. It receives an "
"immutable snapshot of the SI values of all fields (:class:`Values`) and the input signals by port name, and"
" returns the output signals by port name. This separation between the element's state and its computation "
"is what allows JIT compilation, vectorisation and automatic differentiation (ADR-0002)."
msgstr ""

#: lumos.core.element.Element:1 of
msgid "Base class of all LUMOS elements."
msgstr ""

#: lumos.core.element.Element:3 of
msgid "Optional human-readable name of the element."
msgstr ""

#: lumos.core.element.Element:4 of
msgid "Values of the declared fields; fields without a default value are required."
msgstr ""

#: lumos.core.element.Element.name:1 of
msgid "Human-readable name of the element (or ``None``)."
msgstr ""

#: lumos.core.element.Element.ports:1 of
msgid "Return the declared ports by name, inputs and outputs in definition order."
msgstr ""

#: lumos.core.element.Element.values:1 of
msgid "Return an immutable snapshot of the SI values of all fields."
msgstr ""

#: lumos.core.element.Element.transfer:1 of
msgid "Compute the output signals from the field values and the input signals."
msgstr ""

#: lumos.core.element.Element.transfer:3 of
msgid "SI values of the element's fields."
msgstr ""

#: lumos.core.element.Element.transfer:4 of
msgid "Input signals by port name (a sequence of signals for ports accepting several connections)."
msgstr ""

#: lumos.core.element.Element.transfer:6 of
msgid "Output signals by port name."
msgstr ""

#: lumos.core.element.Element.apply:1 of
msgid "Run the transfer function on ``inputs``, checking port names and signal types."
msgstr ""

